hadiths[35]{hadithnumber,text}:
"778","Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Apne kapdon mein se safed pehno, kyonke wo tumharey kapdon mein se behtreen hain, aur unhi mein apne murdon ko kafan do. Ise Abu Dawud aur Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai."
"779","Samura (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Safed pehno, kyonke wo zyada paak aur khushbudaar hain, aur unhi mein apne murdon ko kafan do. Ise Nasaai aur Haakim ne riwayat kya hai."
"780","Bara (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) darmiyaana qad they, aur main ne Aap ko surkh jodey mein dekha, main ne kabhi koi chiz us se zyada khubsurat nahi dekhi. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"781","Abu Juhafa Wahb bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko Makkah mein dekha jabke Aap Abtah mein chamdey ke surkh kheemey mein they, to Bilaal Aap ke wuzu ka pani lekar nikley, to koi chheent-ta aur koi leta, phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) nikley jabke Aap par surkh joda tha, goya main Aap ki pindliyon ki safedi dekh raha hun, to Aap ne wuzu kya aur Bilaal ne azaan di, to main Aap ka munh yahan aur wahan taaqqub karne laga, Aap daayein aur baayein kehtey: Namaz ki taraf aao, kamyaabi ki taraf aao, phir Aap ke liye naiza gaada gaya, phir Aap aagey badhey aur namaz padhi, Aap ke saamney se kutta aur gadha guzarta aur koi nahi rokta. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"782","Abu Ramsa Rifa'a Taimi (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko dekha jabke Aap par do sabz kapdey they. Ise Abu Dawud aur Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai."
"783","Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Fatah Makkah ke din dakhil huey jabke Aap par kaali amaama thi. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"784","Abu Saeed Amr bin Huraish (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Goya main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko dekh raha hun jabke Aap par kaali amaama hai, Aap ne uske donon kinaarey apne kandhon ke darmiyaan latkaey huey hain. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai. Aur unki aik riwayat mein hai: Ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne logon ko khutba diya jabke Aap par kaali amaama thi."
"785","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko teen safed Yahoo ke sooti kapdon mein kafan diya gaya, un mein na qameez thi aur na amaama. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"786","Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aik subah nikley jabke Aap par kaaley baalon ki naqshdaar chaadar thi. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"787","Mugheera bin Shoba (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main aik raat safar mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath tha, to Aap ne mujh se farmaya: Kya tumharey paas pani hai? Main ne kaha: Haan. To Aap apni sawari se utrey aur chaley yahan tak ke raat ke andherey mein chhup gaey, phir tashreef laey to main ne chhoti mashqeeza se Aap par paani daala, to Aap ne apna chehra dhoya jabke Aap par oon ka jubba tha, to Aap apne baazu us se nikaal na sakey yahan tak ke unhey jubbey ke neechey se nikaala, phir apne baazu dhoey aur apne sar ka masah kya, phir main apne mozon ko utarney ke liye jhuka to Aap ne farmaya: Unhey chhor do kyonke main ne unhey paaki mein pehna tha. Aur un par masah kya. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur aik riwayat mein hai: Aur Aap par Shaami tang aasteenon wala jubba tha. Aur aik riwayat mein hai: Ke ye waaqia Ghazwa Tabook mein tha."
"788","Umm Salama (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko sab se mehboob kapda qameez tha. Ise Abu Dawud aur Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai."
"789","Asma bint Yazeed Ansaariya (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki qameez ki aasteen kalaai tak thi. Ise Abu Dawud aur Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai."
"790","Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs takabbur se apna kapda ghaseet-ta hai to Allah qayamat ke din uski taraf nazar nahi farmayega. To Abu Bakr ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak mera tehband dhoonda hota hai yahan tak ke main uska khayaal rakhta hun. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne un se farmaya: Beshak tum un mein se nahi ho jo usey takabbur se kartey hain. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"791","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah qayamat ke din uski taraf nazar nahi farmayega jo apna tehband takabbur se ghaseet-ta hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"792","Unhin se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tehband ka jo hissa takhnon se neechey hai wo dozakh mein hai. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"793","Abu Zarr (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Teen hain jin se Allah qayamat ke din kalaam nahi farmayega aur na unki taraf nazar farmayega aur na unhey paak farmayega, aur unke liye dardnaak azaab hai. Unhon-ne kaha: To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usey teen martaba padha. Abu Zarr ne kaha: Wo naakaam aur khasaarey mein rahey, wo kaun hain ya Rasulullah? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tehband latkaney wala, aur ehsaan jatlaney wala, aur apna saamaan jhooti qasam se baichney wala. Aur unki aik riwayat mein hai: Apna tehband latkaney wala. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"794","Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tehband aur qameez aur amaama latkana, jo koi chiz takabbur se ghaseet-ta hai to Allah qayamat ke din uski taraf nazar nahi farmayega. Ise Abu Dawud aur Nasaai ne riwayat kya hai."
"795","Abu Jurayy Jabir bin Sulaim (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne aik aadmi ko dekha jis ki raey par log sadaa kartey hain, wo koi baat nahi kehta magar wo us se sadaa kartey hain. Main ne kaha: Ye kaun hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam). Main ne kaha: Alaikas salaam ya Rasulullah, do martaba. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Alaikas salaam na kaho, alaikas salaam murdon ka tohfa hai. Main ne kaha: Assalamu alaik. Unhon-ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Kya Aap Allah ke Rasool hain? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Main Allah ka Rasool hun, jab tumhey nuqsaan pahunchy aur tum usey pukaro to wo tum se door kar deta hai, aur jab tumhey qehat ka saal pahunchy aur tum usey pukaro to wo tumharey liye uga deta hai, aur jab tum banjar zameen ya jungle mein ho aur tumhari sawari gum ho jaey phir tum usey pukaro to wo tumhey wapas kar deta hai. Unhon-ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Mujhey waseeyat karein. Aap ne farmaya: Kisi ko bura na kaho. Unhon-ne kaha: To main ne uske baad na kisi aazaad ko bura kaha aur na ghulaam ko, aur na oont ko aur na bakri ko. Aur neki mein se kisi chiz ko haqeer na samjho, aur apne bhai se khanda peshani se baat karo, beshak wo neki mein se hai. Aur apna tehband aadhi pindli tak uthayo, phir agar inkaar karo to takhnon tak, aur tehband latkaney se bacho kyonke wo takabbur mein se hai aur beshak Allah takabbur ko pasand nahi farmata, aur agar koi aadmi tumhey bura kahey aur tumhey us se aar dilaye jo wo tum mein jaanta hai to tum usey us se aar na dilao jo tum us mein jaantey ho, kyonke uska wabaal usi par hai. Ise Abu Dawud aur Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai."
"796","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Aik aadmi tehband latka kar namaz padh raha tha to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us se kaha: Jao aur wuzu karo. To wo gaya aur wuzu kya, phir aaya to Aap ne farmaya: Jao aur wuzu karo. To aik aadmi ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Aap ko kya hai ke Aap ne usey wuzu karne ka hukm diya phir us se khamosh rahey? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak wo tehband latka kar namaz padh raha tha, aur beshak Allah tehband latkaney waley aadmi ki namaz qabool nahi farmata. Ise Abu Dawud ne riwayat kya hai."
"797","Qais bin Bishr Taghlabi se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Mujhey merey walid ne khabar di, aur wo Abud Darda ke humnasheen they, unhon-ne kaha: Dimashq mein Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sahaaba mein se aik aadmi tha jisey Sehel bin Al-Hanzaliya kaha jata tha, aur wo tanhai pasand aadmi tha, kam hi logon se milta tha, wo namaz mein hota, phir jab farigh hota to tasbeeh aur takbeer mein hota yahan tak ke apne ghar walon ke paas aata. To wo hamarey paas se guzra jabke ham Abud Darda ke paas they, to Abud Darda ne kaha: Aisi baat jo hamein faeda dey aur tumhey nuqsaan na dey. Unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik lashkar bheja aur wo aaya, phir un mein se aik aadmi aaya aur us majlis mein baitha jis mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) baithetey they, phir us ne apne pehlu waley aadmi se kaha: Kaash tum hamein dekhtey jab ham dushman se miley, to fulaan ne hamla kya aur naiza maara, phir us ne kaha: Mujh se ley lo, aur main Ghifaari ladka hun, tum uske qaul mein kya dekhtey ho? Us ne kaha: Main nahi dekhta magar uska ajr zaaya ho gaya hai. To ye baat aik aur ne suni aur us ne kaha: Main is mein koi harj nahi dekhta. To un donon ne jhagda kya yahan tak ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne suna aur farmaya: Subhan Allah? Koi harj nahi ke usey ajr diya jaey aur uski tareef ki jaey. To main ne Abud Darda ko dekha ke wo is se khush huey aur apna sar uski taraf uthaney lagey aur kehtey: Kya tum ne ye Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna hai? To wo kehta: Haan. To wo us par dohratey rahey yahan tak ke main kehney laga ke wo apne ghutnon par jhukney waley hain. Unhon-ne kaha: Phir wo aik din hamarey paas se guzra to Abud Darda ne us se kaha: Aisi baat jo hamein faeda dey aur tumhey nuqsaan na dey. Unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein farmaya: Bhalai par kharch karne wala aisa hai jaisa sadqa se apna haath pheelaney wala aur usey band na karne wala. Phir wo aik din hamarey paas se guzra to Abu Darda ne us se kaha: Aisi baat jo hamein faeda dey aur tumhey nuqsaan na dey. Unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Khuraim Asadi kitna achchha aadmi hai! Agar uske baalon ki lambi lat aur uske tehband ka latkana na hota! To ye baat Khuraim tak pahunchi to us ne ustra liya aur us se apni lat kaanon tak kaat di aur apna tehband aadhi pindliyon tak utha liya. Phir wo aik din hamarey paas se guzra to Abu Darda ne us se kaha: Aisi baat jo hamein faeda dey aur tumhey nuqsaan na dey. Unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Beshak tum apne bhaiyon ke paas aaney waley ho, isliye apni sawariyan durust karo aur apne libaas durust karo yahan tak ke tum logon mein til ki tarah hojao, kyonke Allah behayai aur behayai ki baat ko pasand nahi farmata. Ise Abu Dawud ne riwayat kya hai."
"798","Abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Musalman ka tehband aadhi pindli tak hai, aur uske aur takhnon ke darmiyaan mein koi harj, ya koi gunah nahi, phir jo takhnon se neechey hai wo dozakh mein hai, aur jo apna tehband takabbur se ghaseet-ta hai to Allah uski taraf nazar nahi farmayega. Ise Abu Dawud ne riwayat kya hai."
"799","Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas se guzra jabke merey tehband mein dheela pan tha, to Aap ne farmaya: Ae Abdullah! Apna tehband uthayo. To main ne uthaya phir farmaya: Aur zyada. To main ne zyada kya, phir main uske baad uska khayaal rakhney laga. To kuchh logon ne kaha: Kahaan tak? To unhon-ne kaha: Aadhi pindliyon tak. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"800","Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo apna kapda takabbur se ghaseet-ta hai to Allah qayamat ke din uski taraf nazar nahi farmayega. To Umm Salama ne kaha: To aurtein apne daamanon se kya karein? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Wo aik baalisht latkayein. Unhon-ne kaha: Tab to unke qadam khul jaengey. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: To wo aik haath latkayein aur zyada na karein. Ise Abu Dawud aur Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai."
"801","Muaz bin Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs libaas chhor dey Allah ke liye aajizi se jabke wo us par qaadir ho to Allah qayamat ke din usey makhlooq ke sardaron par bulayega yahan tak ke usey ikhtiyaar dega ke imaan ke jodon mein se jisey chahey pehney. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai."
"802","Amr bin Shuaib se apne walid se apne dada (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Allah pasand farmata hai ke apni naimat ka asar apne bandey par dekhey. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai."
"803","Umar bin Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Resham na pehno, kyonke jo usey duniya mein pehneyga wo usey aakhirat mein nahi pehneyga. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"804","Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Resham to wahi pehenta hai jis ka koi hissa nahi. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur Bukhari ki aik riwayat mein hai: Jis ka aakhirat mein koi hissa nahi."
"805","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo duniya mein resham pehneyga wo aakhirat mein nahi pehneyga. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"806","Ali (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko dekha ke Aap ne resham liya aur usey apne daayein haath mein rakha, aur sona liya aur usey apne baayein haath mein rakha, phir farmaya: Beshak ye donon meri ummat ke mardon par haraam hain. Ise Abu Dawud ne riwayat kya hai."
"807","Abu Musa Ashari (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Meri ummat ke mardon par resham aur soney ka libaas haraam kya gaya hai aur unki aurton ke liye halaal kya gaya hai. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai."
"808","Huzaifa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein soney chaandi ke bartanon mein peeney se mana farmaya, aur un mein khaaney se, aur resham aur deebaaj pehen-ney se aur us par baith-ney se. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"809","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Zubair aur Abdur Rahman bin Auf (Raziallahu anhuma) ko khujli ki wjah se resham pehen-ney ki rukhsat di. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"810","Muawiya (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Khazz aur cheetey ki khaal par sawaar na ho. Ise Abu Dawud ne riwayat kya hai."
"811","Abul Maleeh se apne walid (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne darindon ki khaalon se mana farmaya. Ise Abu Dawud aur Tirmizi aur Nasaai ne riwayat kya hai. Aur Tirmizi ki aik riwayat mein hai: Darindon ki khaalon ko bichhaaney se mana farmaya."
"812","Abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab naya kapda pehentey to usey uske naam se pukaartey, amaama ya qameez ya chaadar, aur farmatey: Ae Allah! Terey liye hamd hai Tune mujhey ye pehnaya, main Tujh se uski bhalai aur us bhalai ka sawal karta hun jis ke liye wo banaya gaya hai, aur main Tujh se uske shar aur us shar se panah maangta hun jis ke liye wo banaya gaya hai. Ise Abu Dawud aur Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai."
